%% Review (J-003): the answer stays hidden until the author has tried to recall it (UX-002).
sequenceDiagram
  actor Author
  participant UI as Study UI
  participant Srv as Local server
  participant Log as Review log

  Author->>UI: open review
  UI->>Srv: GET /api/reviews/due
  Srv->>Log: replay lines with box intervals
  Srv-->>UI: due questions
  loop each due question
    UI-->>Author: question only
    Author->>UI: answer from memory, reveal
    UI-->>Author: SEE-I and relation explanations
    Author->>UI: right or wrong
    UI->>Srv: POST /api/reviews
    Srv->>Log: append one line
    Srv-->>UI: new box and due date
    opt wrong
      UI-->>Author: offer the concept's detail with relations, sources and explanations (FR-031, PD-020)
    end
  end
